ki.com/finding-scalpel">Finding A Scalpel</a></td> <td>Stationed at a site in Arizona, for deployment in operations across the American Southwest.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>• MTF-Sigma-25</td> <td>Ghostbusters</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3004">SCP-3004</a></td> <td>Task force utilising astral projection (Project SIGHTSEE) to contain anomalies.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>MTF-Sigma-25</td> <td>Groovy Kids</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-es-029">SCP-ES-029</a></td> <td>SCP-specific task force.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>• MTF-Sigma-31</td> <td>Damocles Shield</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2631">SCP-2631</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1347">SCP-1347</a></td> <td>Multinational military task force formed to carry out 99-Tripurantaka orders in the event of <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2631">SCP-2631</a> activation.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/task-forces#sigma-66">MTF-Sigma-66</a></td> <td>Sixteen Tons</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/sigma-psych-eval">MTF Sigma-66 Post-Mission Psychological Evaluation</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/stick-the-landing">Stick the Landing</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/two-transcribed-conversations-in-very-different-tones">Two Transcribed Conversations In Very Different Tones</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/a-dysfunctional-heist">A Dysfunctional Heist</a></td> <td>Mobile Task Force Sigma-66 is formed of captured members from other GOI. Despite the lack of loyalty the Foundation expects from the assembled team, they find the members' expertise of value.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>• MTF-Sigma-66</td> <td>Steel Veil</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3897">SCP-3897</a></td> <td>MTF used in cover ups, disinformation and amnestisation.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>MTF-Sigma-853</td> <td>Elected Dogcatchers</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1845">SCP-1845</a></td> <td>No description given.</td> </tr> </table> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-