idual hub pages, just include a link. Hubs take priority over the <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/task-forces">canon list</a>.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-353465-4"><a href="javascript:;" >4</a>. Feel free to write whatever here if it's your MTF, but try to keep it fairly unobjectionable if it's not. It's not mandatory, but something more detailed than &quot;SCP-specific Task Force&quot; would be nice!</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-353465-5"><a href="javascript:;" >5</a>. Clowns. They hunt Clowns.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-353465-6"><a href="javascript:;" >6</a>. Ideatic unit representing an item within the confines of a language, analogous to a linguistic meme.</div> </div> 
